	(text_box "- High side sensing circuit for 4-20mA sensors\n- High Precision 0.5% Resistor with a low temperature coefficent.\n- Output should be 0.499V for 4mA and 2.495V for 20mA.\n- Provision for capacitor for low pass filter on inputs\n- Controller can switch off sensor and lodge fault if readings go higher than 26mA (3.3V)"
